00:23:12.510 --> 00:23:17.880
brandonenervold: Making sure that their toilets aren't leaking, that trickle water is never good.

246
00:23:18.200 --> 00:23:24.490
brandonenervold: Like I said, making sure that you have plenty of bacteria in your tank. Don't be pumping your tank out before winter.

