00:23:31.550 --> 00:23:50.589
brandonenervold: as far as… I don't know what other people do, but we… we insulate all our tanks, all our lines. We use the 24-inch foam pads to put in the risers so the air won't blow down in there. Everything we do is try to prevent having issues in the winter. Yeah.

